#: ../../source/tweetnacl_README.md:430
msgid ""
"In short, with *nacl-fast.js* and 1024-byte messages you can expect to "
"encrypt and authenticate more than 57000 messages per second on a typical"
" laptop or more than 14000 messages per second on a $170 smartphone, sign"
" about 200 and verify 100 messages per second on a laptop or 60 and 30 "
"messages per second on a smartphone, per CPU core (with Web Workers you "
"can do these operations in parallel), which is good enough for most "
"applications."
msgstr ""

